<title>USA: Quigley names official.</title>
<headline>Quigley names official.</headline>
<dateline>DOYLESTOWN, Pa. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quigley Corp said on Wednesday it named George Longo as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Longo was previusly employed by KPMG Peat MArwick and Rhone-Poulenc Rorer Inc.</p>
<p>He replaces Eric Kaytes, who was named vice president of management information systems for the company.</p>
